# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# housestyle configuration
#
# Copy this file to `housestyle.conf` (same directory) and fill it in.
# `housestyle.conf` is git-ignored — your paths and names stay local.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Where the corpus and the finished profile live.
#
# Put this OUTSIDE this repository. The corpus contains the full text of
# things you have written — sent mail, chat messages, drafts. That is your
# material, and it must never end up in version control.
#
# No trailing slash.
ROOT=

# Language of the corpus. Selects the word lists under lang/.
# Shipped: de, en. See docs/adding-a-language.md to add your own.
LANG=de

# ─── Redaction ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Names replaced with [Name] before any sample text is shown to a model.
# Comma-separated, substring match. Put clients, colleagues and third
# parties here. You do not need to list yourself.
REDACT=

# ─── Signature anchors ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Lines that mark the start of your automatic mail signature. Everything
# from the first match onward is dropped before measuring.
#
# This matters more than it looks: in the reference corpus the signature
# accounted for 43 percent of all mail text. Measuring it means measuring
# your business card, not your language.
#
# One entry per line as a regular expression, indented under the key.
# Typical anchors: the first line of your signature block, your name line,
# your company name, your street address, any standing marketing line.
SIGNATURE=

# ─── Internal domains ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Mail to these domains is tagged "internal", everything else "external".
# Registers differ sharply between the two, and the profile separates them.
# Comma-separated, substring match.
INTERNAL=

# ─── Words you have rejected ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Words a model keeps proposing that you know are not yours. Comma-
# separated, stem match. The list grows every time you correct a draft.
BLOCKLIST=
